    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Effigy is a third person action-roguelite, hack n slash, set in a Steampunk world. Wield a pair of Weapons that each have their own passives and abilities. Create unique builds by collecting and using powerful Items, Weapon Augments and Abilities to help you defeat the hordes of enslaved machines under the control of The Barons, a group of powerful leaders in control of a tyrannical government.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/94881136dc3f038ecd6d47a3ec78d1f2.poster.avif?t=1753252347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/94881136dc3f038ecd6d47a3ec78d1f2.webm?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/94881136dc3f038ecd6d47a3ec78d1f2.mp4?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/9fe076eb7c86f4a23f828177e70b1f96.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your weapons mid run with powerful Augments that upgrade them and change how they function and how they interact with allies, enemies as well as other weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/d822644cb1debc3a9f35271089f53510.poster.avif?t=1753252347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/d822644cb1debc3a9f35271089f53510.webm?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/d822644cb1debc3a9f35271089f53510.mp4?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/4fe3a893b80f6e65effc20eb76d97b5d.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful items to upgrade yourself, bring down lightning storms, unleash fiery explosions, freeze enemies and even use the power of gravity to decimate enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/2a6f0e49bd0ecce5c8f33caef53bb982.poster.avif?t=1753252347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/2a6f0e49bd0ecce5c8f33caef53bb982.webm?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/2a6f0e49bd0ecce5c8f33caef53bb982.mp4?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/ec804e60a309a53b40af8fe7e5ab35fe.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to unlock new Weapons, Items and fighting styles to aid you in your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/96483aaf9f37731671a9a5e592de1a4b.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up the fight alone or in co-op with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/a9dedfc119fbe6c7d40e0476b65c3c45.avif?t=1753252347\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Effigy is a third person action-roguelite, hack n slash, set in a Steampunk world. Wield a pair of Weapons that each have their own passives and abilities. Create unique builds by collecting and using powerful Items, Weapon Augments and Abilities to help you defeat the hordes of enslaved machines under the control of The Barons, a group of powerful leaders in control of a tyrannical government.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/94881136dc3f038ecd6d47a3ec78d1f2.poster.avif?t=1753252347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/94881136dc3f038ecd6d47a3ec78d1f2.webm?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/94881136dc3f038ecd6d47a3ec78d1f2.mp4?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/9fe076eb7c86f4a23f828177e70b1f96.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your weapons mid run with powerful Augments that upgrade them and change how they function and how they interact with allies, enemies as well as other weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/d822644cb1debc3a9f35271089f53510.poster.avif?t=1753252347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/d822644cb1debc3a9f35271089f53510.webm?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/d822644cb1debc3a9f35271089f53510.mp4?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/4fe3a893b80f6e65effc20eb76d97b5d.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful items to upgrade yourself, bring down lightning storms, unleash fiery explosions, freeze enemies and even use the power of gravity to decimate enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/2a6f0e49bd0ecce5c8f33caef53bb982.poster.avif?t=1753252347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/2a6f0e49bd0ecce5c8f33caef53bb982.webm?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/2a6f0e49bd0ecce5c8f33caef53bb982.mp4?t=1753252347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/ec804e60a309a53b40af8fe7e5ab35fe.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to unlock new Weapons, Items and fighting styles to aid you in your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/96483aaf9f37731671a9a5e592de1a4b.avif?t=1753252347\" width=618 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up the fight alone or in co-op with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903980/extras/a9dedfc119fbe6c7d40e0476b65c3c45.avif?t=1753252347\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Cleave through hordes of enslaved machines in this 1 to 4 player action-roguelite, hack n slash. Equip your Effigy with unique Items and Weapons to fight against The Barons and their machines. Upgrade your Weapons with powerful Augments to modify them and how they play.",
